                  "content": "UHD MODEL: GAP"
                },
                "YgzRP": {
                  "content": "A 1:1 link without a harness entity has no stored record today. Top-level connections exist only as derived DRC output (ConnectionResult, id computed from paths); inside a module the only stored connection is a HarnessDef. Needed: an InterfaceLink {id, a, b, childLinks?} stored on ModuleDef.links, with explicit endpoint targets (self | child) instead of the implicit 'no childModuleId means parent' rule."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
