                  "fill": "$sup-partial"
                },
                "EBeur": {
                  "content": "UHD MODEL: PARTIAL"
                },
                "YgzRP": {
                  "content": "I2C is a composed interface: slots sda/scl are bound by a profile to pin interfaces, and the region tree gives the nesting (SUPPORTED). Per-child links are derived by resolveSubLinks for protocol-matched slots, but nothing stores them, and validatePair only runs between two flat modules, never on a system's links or harnesses."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
