                  "content": "Remapping needs stored child links. ManualLinkDef exists and ValidatePairOptions.manualLinks accepts it, but validatePair never reads it. Capability-only slots (e.g. the NEO Vortex bldc phase dock) never pair and come out unresolved. Needed: childLinks {a, b, locked} on the InterfaceLink or harness, with stored links taking precedence over derived ones."
                }
