          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The same link can be drawn at different levels of detail, set per link or globally: bundled (one line with a conductor count), or conductors (every child link drawn side by side along the same route, keeping its fillets concentric). Opening a link (board 02) is the editable form; the conductor view is read-only detail.",
