                "H526p": {
                  "fill": "$sup-partial"
                },
                "EBeur": {
                  "content": "UHD MODEL: PARTIAL"
                },
                "YgzRP": {
                  "content": "HarnessDef with topology 'wire' and two endpoints exists (robot-car). A harness has no ports, parameters, artifacts, geometry, or traits, so a cable's connectors, length, gauge, and drawing can't be recorded. Recommended: make a harness a ModuleDef kind ('harness') with topology and N ports, so it inherits parameters, artifacts, and geometry."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
