                  "content": "UHD has no notion of a default-visible set, port grouping, or display order. Counts can be derived from interface definitions and max_instances, but grouping by protocol type needs a canonical type registry (protocols[].type is a free string). Needed: optional display hints on ModuleDef {visible, group, side, order} plus the viewer layout document for overrides."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
