          "fill": "$text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Links and ports are coloured by a selectable classification. The default is DOMAIN (electrical, mechanical, pneumatic…). DRC HEALTH matches the alpha app (configured, partial, incompatible, not configured). Domain-specific modes such as ELECTRICAL SIGNAL TYPE colour one domain by interface type and fade the rest. Modules get a parallel classification system later (lifecycle, origin: local vs catalog). A full legend builder comes later; each mode ships with its own legend.",
