                "YgzRP": {
                  "content": "DRC gives a state per pair connection (7 ConnectionState values) and a census status per interface, but only between two flat modules. There is no per-link, per-sub-link, or per-harness state across a system, and capacity results are always empty. Needed: a module-scope evaluator that emits per-link / per-harness / per-sub-link state keyed by canonical path."
