          "content": "A focused, left-to-right view of the interfaces between exactly two modules, like protoboard.ai/validate and the UHD ASCII visualizer. Module A and B sit in fixed columns with ports on their inner edges. Each connection is a shared region spanning the lane, with the parent link drawn thick and child links (slots → pins) as thin conductors; crossovers are drawn as crossings. Unconnected interfaces are listed below, then a verdict. Opened from any link in the system diagram.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
