                },
                "YgzRP": {
                  "content": "validatePair(a, b) → PairValidationResult (connections with subLinks and unresolvedSlots, census, potentials, verdict) already drives /validate. Limits carried over: capability-only slots don't pair, capacity is always empty, and manual child links aren't read. A shared renderer here and on the website needs the viewer's view contract to accept pair results."
