          "fill": "$text-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A harness is drawn as part of the link it carries: module → link line → harness region → link line → module. The region is a dotted outline with a light fill around the harness's own run of the line, so it reads as a physical object (closer to a module) while the link stays a link. Everything sits on a 16 px grid.",
