                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Top: a plain interface link, only a line and its label. Bottom: the same link carried by a harness. Between the module ports it is still one line; the harness's own run sits inside a tight dotted region with a light fill, and the harness name sits outside it as a tab. Small squares mark the harness ends (its connectors). Details (length, gauge, connectors) are in the inspector. Clicking the region selects the harness; clicking the line outside it selects the link.",
